        "email": "michael@bentleypc.com",
        "company": "BentleyPC LLC"
      }
    ],
    "releaseDate": "11/16/2026",
    "description": "Collects CPU frequency state from /sys/devices/system/cpu (per-core current/min/max frequency, governor) and hardware thermal-throttle counters (package_throttle_count, mperf-based if present). Emits JSON events to index=main (sourcetype throttle:status) and throttle.* metrics to index=metrics (sourcetype throttle:metrics); alarm status when a thermal-throttle counter increases since the previous cycle.",
